Scenario-based interview task	Expected command

1	You logged into a Linux server. How do you check your current location?	pwd
2	You want to check all files, including hidden files.	ls -la
3	Your manager asks you to identify the Linux OS version.	cat /etc/os-release
4	You need to check the Linux kernel version.	uname -r
5	You want to know how long the server has been running.	uptime
6	You need to check the current logged-in user.	whoami
7	You want to check all users currently logged into the server.	who
8	You need to switch to the root user.	sudo -i
9	You want to return from root to the normal user.	exit
10	You need to check the server hostname.	hostname
